</p></div></li></ol><div class="bde-f-container-139-146 bde-f-container ot-welcome-help" data-entrance="slideUp"><img class="bde-f-image-139-142 bde-f-image ot-welcome-photo" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/004-1-scaled-e1787001316285.jpg" alt="Dan from Own Trade" loading="lazy" width="144" height="144"><div class="bde-f-container-139-145 bde-f-container ot-welcome-help-text"><p class="bde-f-text-139-143 bde-f-text ot-welcome-help-title">
